flowchart TD
    %% Scenario: how the pure evaluator walks rules and builds a decision.
    classDef proc fill:#eff6ff,stroke:#1d4ed8,color:#172554
    classDef core fill:#f5f3ff,stroke:#6d28d9,color:#2e1065
    classDef out fill:#ecfdf5,stroke:#047857,color:#064e3b
    classDef note fill:#f8fafc,stroke:#334155,color:#0f172a

    Start["Evaluate(revision, event, facts)"]:::proc
    Sort["compiled rules sorted by priority,<br/>highest first"]:::core
    Start --> Sort

    Loop["take next rule"]:::proc
    Sort --> Loop

    Pred["evalPredicate on event.Data"]:::proc
    Loop --> Pred

    Pred --> Walk{"composite or leaf?"}:::proc
    Walk -->|all / any / not| Rec["recurse into children<br/>short circuit on all false<br/>or any true"]:::proc
    Rec --> Pred
    Walk -->|leaf| Path["resolve dollar-dot path in data,<br/>missing path means false<br/>except exists and not_exists"]:::proc
    Path --> Cmp["compare with operator,<br/>numbers normalized before compare"]:::proc
    Cmp --> Pred

    Pred -->|true| Match["record rule id in matched,<br/>build effects for each then action,<br/>effect id from tenant, event, rule set,<br/>revision, rule id, action index"]:::out
    Pred -->|false| Other["build effects from otherwise<br/>when the rule defines it"]:::note

    Match --> Mode{"match_mode?"}:::proc
    Mode -->|first_match| Stop["stop after the first match"]:::proc
    Mode -->|all_matches| Next["continue with the next rule"]:::proc
    Other --> Next
    Next --> More{"more rules?"}:::proc
    More -->|yes| Loop
    More -->|no| Hash
    Stop --> Hash

    Hash["decision hash = sha256 of<br/>content hash, matched ids, effect ids,<br/>event id and facts hash"]:::out
    Explanations["explanations: rule id, matched,<br/>priority, reason, actions"]:::note
    Hash --> Result["Decision: matched rules, effects,<br/>hash, explanations"]:::out
    Hash --> Explanations

    Pure["No I/O, no clock, no randomness.<br/>Same revision and event always<br/>produce the same hash."]:::note
    Result -.-> Pure
